OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThere'll be
OL,6,Fwarm sunshine to end the day, and
OL,7,Fclear spells this evening. However,
OL,8,Fcloud will gradually increase from the
OL,9,Fnorthwest overnight perhaps with an
OL,10,Fisolated shower breaking out later.
OL,11,FRemaining mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA fairly cloudy start to
OL,14,FThursday morning, with a small chance
OL,15,Fof a shower. Skies will brighten from
OL,16,Fthe north into the afternoon, with
OL,17,Fsunny spells. Feeling fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
